{{!< default}}
{{!-- The TFR rail, first on the page and pinned under the masthead as on the reader (Ian, 2026-09-23). --}}
{{> "faith-received/_tfr-rail"}}
{{#contentFor "moHead"}}
<title>Controversies | The Faith Received | Mere Orthodoxy</title>
<meta name="description" content="The controversies as the library's own controversy literature argued them, debate by debate and question by question: Thomists and Scotists (with the Nominalists and the Jesuits), Rome and the Reformation, the Reformed and their adversaries, the Lutherans and the Socinians, each side in his own words from the library's pages." />
<link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel=stylesheet href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Source+Serif+Pro:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap">
<style>
.tfr-tool{--bg:var(--color-bg,#F0F0ED);--fg:var(--color-dark,#1C1C1A);--muted:var(--color-muted,#5A5A56);--border:var(--color-rule,#D8D8D3);--card-bg:var(--color-card,#FFFFFF);--highlight:var(--color-highlight,#E7E7E2);--accent:var(--color-accent,#8A3B2E);--sel:var(--card-bg);--font-display:"EB Garamond",Georgia,serif;--font-body:"Source Serif Pro",Georgia,serif;--sans:"Source Serif Pro",Georgia,serif;--ease:cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
  --s-thomist:#2F5E99;--s-scotist:#7A4E9B;--s-nominalist:#A87420;--s-jesuit:#1F7A80;--s-augustinian:#94506E;--s-other:#7A7A76;--s-bonaventurian:#66702E}
/* THE CONTROVERSIES (2026-10-21, owner: "as comprehensive and deep as possible, like being able to see differences between Thomas vs
   Scotus (like Juan de Rada shows) and more"). v1/enrich/controversies (runs/minimax_1019/controversies): a pair's controversies as the
   library's own controversy literature argued them, question by question, each side in his own words.
   ORGANIZED (2026-10-21, owner: "simply organize this as well … we want to see metaphysical questions and thomas vs scotists"): one row
   grammar for the view (a label, the text, the page at the right): position, arguments, own words, judgment.
   THE DEBATES (2026-10-22, owner: "thomist vs scotus is important, has authors lined up; cajetan has substantial interaction with scotus;
   u need to do a rethink and repass of controversies"): the works of controversy under the debate each pair file names; a debate's own
   view lines its authors up (by school where the school map knows them, else side by side) and gathers its controversies under the
   classic question each answers, each side in its authors' own words. School colours are dots beside the school's name, never alone.
   THE DESIGN PASS (2026-10-22, owner: "design is impeccable"): the debate is the page and the board its switcher, one line a debate with
   its count; the authors by school read as an index, one line a school; an argument's page sits under the argument, so the argument
   keeps the width of its side; an opinion reads from top to bottom; a filter that adds up is a check toggle and the locus a select; a
   chosen row is a sheet on the stone, not a block of ink; headings step one level at a time (h1 the page, h2 the debate or the work,
   h3 the question, h4 the work answering it or a side, h5 a side within a work). fr-reading-system.css loads after this sheet and sets
   --bg, --fg, --muted, --border, --card-bg, --highlight and --accent on :root[data-site]; the tokens here that it does not name
   (--sel, the school colours) are this page's own.
   THE FULL CARD (2026-10-22 evening, owner: "now other controversies should do that too"; "i dont want just two sentences i like the
   depth the old controversies had"; "with block quotes"): a debate's question opens every controversy as the work's own view draws it,
   in full and open: the sides with every argument and its page, the opinions by school in their own words, the judgment with its
   reasons, every passage set in at full length with its page and Preview. "Compact" folds them again, for a reader who asks. The
   reception (who holds what, by school and century; the map; the atlas; the Reformed and Lutheran paths; where else it is argued) is a
   pane beside the cards on a wide screen and a fold above them on a narrower one, never the card again.
   THE RAIL AND THE READING (2026-10-22 night, owner: "do more passes to make this easy to navigate, again no endless scrolling and
   reading should happen to the side"; of the grid of who parts from whom: "this is unreadable not intuitive overwhelming"; "clearly laid
   out"): a debate opens on its great quarrels, whom its authors answer and its topics, the grid of every author behind a disclosure; then
   its questions in a rail (under their locus or topic, Suárez's sections under their disputation) beside the reading: the question, the
   positions taken on it, one controversy at a time behind a pager, the brief of its card over its full record. On a phone the reading
   is a sheet over the rail. */
.tfr-tool *{box-sizing:border-box}
.tfr-tool a{color:var(--fg);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}
.tfr-tool :is(a,button,summary,input,select):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:2px}
.tfr-tool [hidden]{display:none!important}
.tfr-tool .wrap{max-width:92rem;margin:0 auto;padding:1.8rem 1.2rem 4rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font:500 2rem/1.2 var(--font-display);margin:.2rem 0 .5rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .lede{max-width:66ch;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 1.4rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .ct{color:var(--muted);font:400 .8rem/1.3 var(--sans);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .sr{position:absolute;left:-9999px}
.tfr-tool .sc-thomist{--sc:var(--s-thomist)}
.tfr-tool .sc-scotist{--sc:var(--s-scotist)}
.tfr-tool .sc-nominalist{--sc:var(--s-nominalist)}
.tfr-tool .sc-jesuit{--sc:var(--s-jesuit)}
.tfr-tool .sc-augustinian{--sc:var(--s-augustinian)}
.tfr-tool .sc-othermedieval{--sc:var(--s-other)}
.tfr-tool .sc-bonaventurian,.tfr-tool .sc-bonaventurians{--sc:var(--s-bonaventurian)}
.tfr-tool .pt-orthodox,.tfr-tool .pt-voetian{--sc:var(--s-thomist)}
.tfr-tool .pt-cocceian{--sc:var(--s-bonaventurian)}
.tfr-tool .pt-antinomian{--sc:var(--s-nominalist)}
.tfr-tool .pt-baxterian,.tfr-tool .pt-neonomian{--sc:var(--s-jesuit)}
.tfr-tool .pt-amyraldian,.tfr-tool .pt-arminian{--sc:var(--s-augustinian)}
.tfr-tool .pt-baptist{--sc:var(--s-scotist)}
.tfr-tool .pt-lutheran,.tfr-tool .pt-papist,.tfr-tool .pt-socinian{--sc:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .pt-other{--sc:var(--s-other)}
.tfr-tool .dot{display:inline-block;flex:none;width:.6rem;height:.6rem;margin-right:.45rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sc,var(--s-other));vertical-align:.08em}
.tfr-tool .dot.sc-none{background:none;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--s-other)}
.tfr-tool .pty{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;margin-left:.5rem;padding:0 .5rem 0 .4rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;color:var(--fg);font:600 .8rem/1.5 var(--sans);white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:.15em}
.tfr-tool .pty .dot{width:.5rem;height:.5rem;margin-right:.3rem;vertical-align:0}
.tfr-tool .sch{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.tfr-tool .pairs{margin:0 0 1.8rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.6rem;padding:.65rem .1rem;font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary>span:first-child{flex:none;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary::after{content:"";flex:none;align-self:center;width:.42rem;height:.42rem;border-right:1.5px solid currentColor;border-bottom:1.5px solid currentColor;transform:translateY(-.15rem) rotate(45deg);margin-left:.15rem}
.tfr-tool .pairs[open]>summary::after{transform:translateY(.1rem) rotate(-135deg)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary .cur{margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font:1rem/1.3 var(--font-body);text-align:right;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;min-width:0}
.tfr-tool .pairs[open]>summary .cur{display:none}
.tfr-tool .dbl{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:.15rem 0 1rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(18.5rem,1fr));gap:.3rem 1.8rem}
.tfr-tool .dbl a.dl{display:block;height:100%;padding:.5rem .6rem .55rem;margin:0 -.6rem;border-radius:6px;color:var(--fg);text-decoration:none}
.tfr-tool .dl-t{display:block;font:500 1.25rem/1.25 var(--font-display);text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .dl-s{display:block;margin-top:.2rem;color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.45 var(--sans);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .dl-s .ct{font-size:inherit}
.tfr-tool .dbl a.dl:hover{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .dbl a.dl[aria-current="page"]{background:var(--sel);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .pair{margin:0 0 1.4rem}
.tfr-tool .pair h2{font:500 1.6rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .45rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .pair h2 .ct,.tfr-tool .deb-head h2 .ct{margin-left:.5rem}
.tfr-tool .lab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr);gap:.3rem 1.1rem;margin:0;max-width:72ch}
.tfr-tool .lab>div{display:contents}
.tfr-tool .lab dt{color:var(--muted);font:600 .8rem/1.95 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .lab dd{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(15rem,19rem) minmax(0,1fr);gap:2rem;align-items:start}
.tfr-tool .cols.has-rcp{grid-template-areas:"nav rcp" "nav art";grid-template-rows:auto 1fr}
.tfr-tool .cols.has-rcp>.nav{grid-area:nav}
.tfr-tool .cols.has-rcp>.c{grid-area:art}
.tfr-tool .cols.has-rcp>.rcp{grid-area:rcp}
.tfr-tool #c,.tfr-tool #dq{container:card/inline-size;min-width:0}
@media (min-width:80rem){.tfr-tool .cols.has-rcp{grid-template-columns:minmax(14rem,16.5rem) minmax(0,1fr) minmax(17.5rem,21rem);grid-template-areas:"nav art rcp";grid-template-rows:auto;gap:1.8rem}
.tfr-tool .cols.has-rcp>.rcp{position:sticky;top:.8rem;max-height:calc(100vh - 1.6rem);overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;scrollbar-width:thin}}
.tfr-tool .nav{display:block;position:sticky;top:.8rem;max-height:calc(100vh - 1.6rem);overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;padding:2px 2px 0}
.tfr-tool .find{width:100%;min-height:2.4rem;padding:.45rem .7rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:1rem var(--font-body);margin:0 0 .6rem}
.tfr-tool .find::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.1rem .2rem;margin:0 0 .7rem}
.tfr-tool .chips button,.tfr-tool .tgl{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;min-height:2rem;padding:.2rem .5rem .2rem .4rem;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:600 .8rem/1.2 var(--sans);cursor:pointer;text-align:left}
.tfr-tool .chips button::before,.tfr-tool .tgl::before{content:"";flex:none;width:.75rem;height:.75rem;border:1.5px solid var(--muted);border-radius:2px}
.tfr-tool .chips button[aria-pressed="true"]::before,.tfr-tool .tgl[aria-pressed="true"]::before{background:var(--fg);border-color:var(--fg);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .chips button:hover,.tfr-tool .tgl:hover{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .chips button .ct,.tfr-tool .tgl .ct{margin-left:-.1rem}
@media (pointer:coarse){.tfr-tool .chips button,.tfr-tool .tgl{min-height:2.75rem}}
.tfr-tool .books{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .books details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .books summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.55rem .2rem;font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display);list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem}
.tfr-tool .books summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .books summary small{color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .books ul{list-style:none;margin:.2rem 0 .6rem;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .books li button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:.45rem .6rem;border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.35 var(--font-body);cursor:pointer;border-radius:6px;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .books li button:hover{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .books li button[aria-current="true"]{background:var(--sel);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .books li button small{display:block;margin-top:.1rem;color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.35 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .c-head .qh{font:500 1.6rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .6rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .c-head .lab{max-width:80ch}
.tfr-tool .kind{display:inline-block;padding:.05rem .55rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;font:600 .8rem/1.5 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .pg{font-size:.8rem;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .r1{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:.4rem 1rem}
.tfr-tool .r1>span,.tfr-tool .r1>p{min-width:0;max-width:70ch}
.tfr-tool .fold{margin:.7rem 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .fold>summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.45rem 0;font:600 .8rem/1.4 var(--sans);color:var(--muted);list-style:none}
.tfr-tool .fold>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .fold>summary::before{content:"+";display:inline-block;width:1rem;font-weight:400}
.tfr-tool .fold[open]>summary::before{content:"\2212"}
.tfr-tool .rows{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .rows>li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.2rem 1rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.45rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .rows>li:first-child{border-top:0}
.tfr-tool .fold .rows{margin:0 0 .5rem}
.tfr-tool ol.args{counter-reset:arg}
.tfr-tool ol.args>li{grid-template-columns:1.1rem minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:.5rem;row-gap:.15rem}
.tfr-tool ol.args>li::before{counter-increment:arg;content:counter(arg);grid-row:1/span 2;color:var(--muted);font:600 .8rem/1.75 var(--sans);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool ol.args>li>.pgs{grid-column:2;justify-self:start}
.tfr-tool .sides{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.8rem;margin:1.4rem 0 1rem}
@container card (max-width:38rem){.tfr-tool .sides{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.4rem}}
.tfr-tool .side,.tfr-tool .op,.tfr-tool .judgment{container:col/inline-size}
.tfr-tool .sd-h{font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .2rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg);text-wrap:balance;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.tfr-tool .sd-h.long{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.4}
.tfr-tool .lbl{display:flex;gap:.4rem;align-items:baseline;margin:1rem 0 .3rem;color:var(--muted);font:600 .8rem/1.4 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .side .pos{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .ops{margin:1.4rem 0 1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .op{padding:1.1rem 0 1.1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .op>*{max-width:70ch}
.tfr-tool .op-h{font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .25rem;text-wrap:balance;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.tfr-tool .op-h.long{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.4}
.tfr-tool .pf{margin:.1rem 0 .4rem;font:.8rem/1.5 var(--sans);color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .pf .dot{width:.5rem;height:.5rem;margin:0 .3rem 0 .15rem}
.tfr-tool .op .pos{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .res{margin:.2rem 0 .8rem;padding:.65rem .85rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card-bg)}
.tfr-tool .res .lbl{margin:0 0 .2rem;color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .res .pos{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool p.who{margin:0 0 .35rem;font:600 1rem/1.4 var(--font-body);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.tfr-tool p.who a{text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}
.tfr-tool .side .pos+.who,.tfr-tool .side .own+.who{margin-top:.9rem}
.tfr-tool .gist{margin:0 0 .6rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool figure.own{margin:.7rem 0 1.15rem;max-width:72ch}
.tfr-tool .side>figure.own:first-of-type,.tfr-tool .side>:is(h5,h6)+figure.own{margin-top:.6rem}
.tfr-tool figure.own blockquote{position:relative;margin:0;padding:0 0 0 1.35rem;font:italic 400 1.0625rem/1.6 var(--font-body);color:var(--fg);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool figure.own blockquote::before{content:"\201C";position:absolute;left:-.05rem;top:-.12em;font:400 1.9rem/1 var(--font-display);color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool figure.own blockquote p{margin:0}
.tfr-tool figure.own blockquote[lang="la"]{font-style:normal}
.tfr-tool figure.own figcaption{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:.15rem .75rem;margin:.35rem 0 0 1.35rem;font:.8rem/1.6 var(--sans);color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool figure.own figcaption>span:first-child{min-width:0}
.tfr-tool figure.own .says{max-width:70ch;margin:.3rem 0 0 1.35rem;font:.8rem/1.55 var(--sans);color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .ql{position:relative;appearance:none;border:0;background:none;padding:0;color:var(--fg);font:600 .8rem/1.6 var(--sans);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--border);text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .ql:hover,.tfr-tool .ql[aria-expanded="true"]{text-decoration-color:currentColor}
@media (pointer:coarse){.tfr-tool .ql::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-.65rem -.35rem}}
.tfr-tool .own-la{margin:.55rem 0 0 1.35rem}
.tfr-tool .own-la[hidden]{display:none}
.tfr-tool .own-la .ql-h{margin:0 0 .2rem;font:.8rem/1.5 var(--sans);color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .own-la .ql-t{margin:0;font:1rem/1.6 var(--font-body);color:var(--fg);text-wrap:pretty}
