{{!-- /the-faith-received/controversies/: the controversies, as The Faith Received has them (tools/prdl_reader_prototype/controversies.html, 2026-10-22):
     the debates (index.json names them; a controversy's debate is the adversary it names, so a work argues in several), each opening on its
     great quarrels and its questions in a rail beside the reading (#debate/<debate>; one question #debate/<debate>/<question id>/<n>, n the
     controversy shown; the topic and the among toggle in the query, ?topic=…&among=1; from v1/enrich/controversies/debates/<debate>.json,
     the positions from digest/<debate>.json): one controversy at a time, each side in its authors' own words, the reception beside it. The works
     are its sources: the By work tab (#debate/<debate>/works) and each work's own view (#<pair>, #<controversy id>), which reads its
     controversies one by one and links each up to its debate's question (v1/enrich/controversies on the library worker). The hero is the
     theme's; the body and faith-controversies.js the library's. --}}
<section class="bhero bhero--tool">
  <div class="bhero-inner container">
