    <h1 class="bhero-title">The controversies</h1>
    <p class="bhero-lede">The disputes of the schools and the confessions, debate by debate and question by question, as their own works of controversy argued them: each side's position and arguments, the work's judgment, and each side in his own words.</p>
  </div>
</section>
